    "Name": "Hippogriff",
    "Details": "The Hippogriff is a Clan Snow Raven design, which was created as part of their need for additional ground troops for their Touman. Made as a companion to the Gorgon, the Hippogriff was designed as a mobile light fire support unit. Considered to be a Heavy ProtoMech, the design is lightly armed for its size. Its only weaponry is a pair of LRM-2 Launchers.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapons - Missile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.978</color></b>",
